        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">妖精魔法地传送到最远 30尺的一处它可见的未被占据空间。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">在使用精类步后，妖精可以立即令魔法黑暗充斥于它 5 尺内的一个 5 尺立方区域，魔法黑暗持续直到妖精的下回合结束。</span></p><p>The fey magically teleports up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space it can see. The fey can fill a 5-foot cube within 5 feet of it with magical darkness, which lasts until the end of its next turn.</p></div>",
